---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Full Stack</h2>
		
<ul>
<li> programming languages: Python, JavaScript, Java</li>
<li> Web development: HTML, CSS, frameworks (Angular)</li>
<li> Databases: SQL</li>
<li> Version Control: GitHub.</p></li>
</ul>
	</div>
	
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="trophy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Soft Skills</h2>
      <ul>
<li>Problem Solving</li>
<li>Clear Communication and Collaboration (often in international teams).</li>
<li>Adaptability: Learn new technologies quickly.</li>
<li>Critical Thinking to analyze project needs</p></li>
</ul>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-500);
		border-radius:1.2emrem;
		padding: 1rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-500_20);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10rem;
	}

	

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 10rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-3xl);
		}
	}
	
</style>
